# Single source of truth for the fleet's identities.
#
# Format: agent_id|service_account_id|purpose
# The IAM script, the permission table in the README, and the agent registry
# seeder all read this file, so the three can never disagree.

sentinel|overturn-sentinel|Screens inbound documents for injection and unexpected PII
intake|overturn-intake|Extracts structured fields from a denial letter
retrieval|overturn-retrieval|Finds governing policy sections in the vector index
mapping|overturn-mapping|Maps chart evidence against each policy criterion
drafting|overturn-drafting|Writes the appeal letter from satisfied criteria only
verification|overturn-verification|Checks every citation before a draft can be approved
lifecycle|overturn-lifecycle|Escalates overdue cases on a schedule
orchestrator|overturn-orchestrator|Cloud Run services that route between agents
